## Tower round 6 (2026-11-15): the vitest-5 fallout and the collation fix

- The flags of the vitest-5 cycles were triaged with LC_ALL=C comparisons:
  - Gate collation bug (real, fixed in a95a10cc): sort and comm used different
    collations, so comm's result was locale-dependent — the source of every
    "comm: input is not in sorted order" warning since the first gate run. key() now
    runs LC_ALL=C end to end.
